# Everything under build/ is scratch: render segments, logs, contact sheets,
# preview PNGs, the fetched font and logo caches. Rather than chase each new
# throwaway filename, ignore the directory and list the few files that are real
# inputs to build.py or genuinely useful helpers.
build/*
!build/fonts.py
!build/wm.py
!build/shot.mjs
!build/copycheck.mjs
!build/fonts.css
!build/wordmark.path
!build/wordmark.vb
!build/wordmark.svg
!build/noise.b64
!build/icons.js

__pycache__/
